<title>USA: Schering unit sells Molecular stake.</title>
<headline>Schering unit sells Molecular stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schering Corp, a unit of Schering-Plough Corp, said Tuesday it has sold its stake in Molecular Devices Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Schering said it sold 541,082 common shares of Molecular Devices on August 15 for $8.00 a share or $4.3 million.</p>
<p>Schering said it sold the shares in the ordinary course of its business.</p>
</text>
